# ============================================================================
# Drone Training Platform — root ignore rules
#
# Subprojects manage their own language/tool ignores:
#   frontend/.gitignore  → Next.js, TypeScript, Vercel
#   backend/.gitignore   → Python, FastAPI, ProjectAirSim artifacts
#
# This file only covers cross-cutting concerns and root-level artifacts,
# so the same pattern is not duplicated three times.
# ============================================================================

# ----- Runtime data: user uploads + persisted state -----
# /db/img is mounted by FastAPI as /media (avatars); /db/data holds runtime
# state (scenario progress, etc.). These regenerate at runtime.
/db/img
/db/data

# ----- Root-level logs -----
# Backend logs, ProjectAirSim client logs, etc. Anything *.log at the repo
# root. (Log files inside frontend/ or backend/ are also handled by their
# own .gitignore.)
/*.log

# ----- Root-level secrets -----
# Real env files must never be committed. Share a template via /.env.example
# instead. frontend/.env*.local and backend/.env are handled by their own
# .gitignore files.
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example

# ----- Root-level scratch scripts -----
# Real backend source lives under /backend/. Anything *.py at the repo root
# is a stray / scratch file. Move intentional scripts into /backend instead.
/*.py

# ----- OS / shell clutter (matches at every level below the repo root) -----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ----- Tooling caches that may surface at the repo root -----
.cache/
.turbo/
.serverless/

env/